{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10137040","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10137040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1013704001:1":{"text":"沙奎尔！我带来了上面的命令。","source_cn":"沙奎尔！我带来了上面的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1455ACFB784DA39D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013704002:1":{"text":"这段时间，你要严守营地门户，防止闲杂人等接近日神殿——","source_cn":"这段时间，你要严守营地门户，防止闲杂人等接近日神殿——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF21FE331A2D307F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013704003:2":{"text":"闲杂人等？指的是我们吗？","source_cn":"闲杂人等？指的是我们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1033C0BF1B447BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013704004:1":{"text":"嗯？！闲杂人等竟然就在这里！沙奎尔，他们是谁？","source_cn":"嗯？！闲杂人等竟然就在这里！沙奎尔，他们是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC130F8E81BCA896B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013704005:1":{"text":"是我可敬的对手，拥有着超出普通魔偶的力量。","source_cn":"是我可敬的对手，拥有着超出普通魔偶的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE956F27EC7ED5C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013704006: